-- HUD panel positions (watermark, keybind list, feature bar). These are not menu
-- rows: dragging a panel writes its absolute screen spot straight into cfg, so
-- the normal profile save/restore carries it and the panels come back exactly
-- where they were left. -1 means "never placed", which falls back to the
-- anchored corner; the draw code clamps a restored spot to the current screen so
-- a smaller window can never park a panel off the edge.
cfg.hud_mark_x,cfg.hud_mark_y=-1,-1
