-- Muzzle velocity and bullet drop, straight out of the game dump
-- (Items.Defs plus the GUN_BALANCE live table and the PROJ defaults). Every
-- value is in studs: speed is studs per second, gravity is studs per second
-- squared. 1 stud is 0.28 m, so the LR Sniper's 2600 studs/s is 728 m/s and a
-- full-draw arrow at 220 studs/s is 61 m/s, both matching how the weapons feel
-- in game. Guns carry their own fall rate: 8 for an ordinary bullet, 15 for
-- shotgun pellets, 30 for the Bolt Action and 24 for the LR Sniper (the live
-- balance table raises those two above the default so long shots really drop).
-- First match wins, so the specific names sit above the generic ones (Custom
-- SMG before SMG, Semi-Automatic Rifle before Rifle). Lives on PF so it costs
-- no extra main-local.
PF.guns={
